{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Radiant Volley|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Mel
|skill        = Q
|icon         = Mel Radiant Volley.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Mel''' launches a barrage of luminous bolts at the target location over {{tt|{{fd|0.5}} seconds|Time between first and last explosion}} which distribute evenly in the area. Each bolt explodes upon landing to deal {{as|magic damage}} to nearby enemies, with all explosions after the first dealing reduced damage.
|leveling     = {{st|Initial Explosion Magic Damage|{{ap|60 to 160}} {{as|(+ 55% AP)}}}}
{{st|Magic Damage per Subsequent Explosion|{{ap|5 to 13}} {{as|(+ 5% AP)}}}}
{{st|Number of Bolts|{{ap|6 to 10}}}}
{{st|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|5*5+60|7*6+85|9*7+110|11*8+135|13*9+160}} {{as|(+ {{ap|5*5+55|6*5+55|7*5+55|8*5+55|9*5+55}}% AP)}}}}
|description2 = The bolts momentarily grant {{tip|sight}} during their travel, while the explosions grant {{tip|sight}} over their target area. Both can see through {{tip|brush}} and [[terrain]].
|cast time    = {{fd|0.35}}
|cost         = {{ap|70 to 90}}
|costtype     = Mana
|cooldown     = {{ap|10 to 6}}
|target range = 950
|speed        = {{tt|3800|Bolt speed}}
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tt|200|Explosion radius}}|{{tip|sight|icononly=true}}{{tt|100|Bolt sight radius}}}}<!-- / {{tt|?|Explosion sight radius, seems to be smaller than the explosion radius}}-->
|customlabel  = {{tt|Spread|Between the two furthermost explosions}}
|custominfo   = {{tip|cr|icononly=true}} 50
|damagetype   = Magic
|targeting    = Location
|affects      = Enemies
|spelleffects = aoedot
|spellshield  = special
|projectile   = true
|outofrange   = walk to location
|notes        = 
* {{tip|Spell shield}} will only block a single explosion.
* For the given number of ''Radiant Volley'' bolts, the spread will result in the same individual areas being affected over the duration '''invariably'''.
** Each individual missile is explicitly assigned an explosion location at a small offset from the cast location. This varies by missile, which results in their combined area of effect distributing over a total radius of [explosion radius + maximum spread] = 200 + 50 = 250 units.
*** This means that the distribution area is not random.
*** The order of bolts however, which will determine the order of individual areas to be affected per explosion, ''is'' random.
**** '''Mel''' launching the missiles in the same arcing motion for every ''Radiant Volley'' cast does not correlate with which missile is being fired at the time. The height and gravity of each missile are irrelevant.
*** Note that the combined area of effect may not always be the maximum possible (circle with radius of 250 units); this drawback diminishes with a higher number of bolts as the new missiles fill the gaps within.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
<!-- Blurb -->
|blurbicon    = Mel Radiant Volley.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Mel}} concentrates a bombardment of luminous bolts that explode in an area, dealing {{as|magic damage}}.
}}
